            "note": "Tripo Studio 图片页 GPT Image 2.5（附概念裁图参考），2 张里选第 1 张；背景按色键连同封闭空隙一起抠掉",
            "source_image": "Statue_1.webp"
          },
          "prompt": "MANDATORY: ONE SINGLE HORIZONTAL ROW of exactly four separate orthographic views of the SAME object, left to right: 1 FRONT view; 2 LEFT side view (object turned so its front points to the LEFT edge of the image); 3 BACK view; 4 RIGHT side view (object turned so its front points to the RIGHT edge of the image). Same scale and same ground line in all four, wide empty gaps between the views, every view complete and not cropped. Plain flat light neutral grey background (#D6D6D6). No floor, no ground shadow, no text, no labels, no frames, no perspective, no extra objects. No fire, no smoke, no sparks, no lava, no glow halo: hot cracks, ember beds, flame tips and lantern glass are painted only as flat opaque bright orange-yellow colour areas.\n\nREFERENCE: the attached image is a crop of our approved scene concept. Redraw ONLY the colossal seated statue from it as a standalone game asset, keeping its shapes, proportions, materials and colours, simplified as described below; ignore everything else in the crop.\n\nSTYLE: stylized hand-painted 3D game environment asset: thick chunky silhouette that still reads as a solid black shape, broad clean faceted planes, two or three dominant colour blocks (dark violet-grey basalt, warm aged bronze, deep vermilion lacquer), soft painted gradients, a few medium-size ornaments, sparse wear, soot-darkened edges. No photorealism, no micro-grain, no fine brick seams, no dense cracks, no tiny carvings, no harsh highlights. Anything at ground level is basalt, stone or cast iron; timber only high up on buildings.\n\nOBJECT (20m wide x 28m tall x 16m deep): A colossal seated stone statue of the fire god of the south, carved from dark violet-grey basalt with warm bronze trims, on a stepped rock throne base. He sits upright facing the FRONT: broad muscular bare chest with a bronze collar plate, a stern bearded human face, and a tall crown of flame-shaped bronze spikes rising behind the head like a halo (solid sculpted metal, the flame tips painted flat bright orange-yellow). ASYMMETRIC POSE: his right hand (on the image's left in the FRONT view) holds a very tall bronze staff planted on the base, topped with a ring-and-trident head that rises above the crown; his left hand rests flat on his left knee. A heavy draped stone robe over the legs, big bare feet with clear toes. The throne base is a chunky stepped rock plinth about 6m tall. PROPORTIONS: FRONT and BACK views about 0.75 times as wide as tall; LEFT and RIGHT views about 0.6 times as wide as tall.",
